# Helping Hand: "Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped."
# Bot1's Faithless Looting discards Jacked Rabbit ({X}{1}{W}) and Questing Beast (mana value 4). Questing Beast cannot be
# targeted (CR 115.1, 601.2c); Jacked Rabbit can, since X is 0 for a card in a graveyard (CR 107.3m, and the card's
# ruling), and it returns tapped (CR 110.5b) as a 1/2 with no +1/+1 counters - X is 0 as it enters, too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Faithless Looting
Jacked Rabbit
Questing Beast
Helping Hand
Plains
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

